  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Propaganda; overall-intent-description: The image depicts the Google logo in an office setting, overlaid with text that accuses Google of controlling and manipulating news to shape public thought and fear, ultimately leading to the disappearance of truth unless people unite en masse. The overall intent is propagandistic, aiming to influence opinion by portraying Google as a manipulative entity with global control over information, thereby encouraging viewers to distrust the company and potentially mobilize against it. The text uses a conspiratorial tone and implies a dystopian scenario, which is a common tactic in propaganda to provoke fear and action. The visual of the Google logo juxtaposed with the accusatory text serves to directly associate the company with the described negative behavior, leveraging the recognizable brand to amplify the message's impact. This meme is designed to sway public perception and potentially incite resistance or activism against Google, fitting the definition of propaganda as a tool to influence opinions or actions toward a specific goal.",
